"Negotiations open only when both traders are vouched for by an authorized witness."
"The other trader appears in their own chair with their half of the table and its objects."
"Each must keep a hand on the table; lifting both hands cuts the connection."
"No one can physically attack through the table."
"Civilians with a selectee cannot see or hear the other party, nor they them."
"Foreign speech shows as subtitles centered on the speaker's chest."
"To finish, both say or tap Confirm Class Trade; reassigning the classes takes a while."
